---
import Layout from "../Layouts/DefaultLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
---

<Layout title="Studio Eien" description="Welcome to Studio Eien">
  <main>
    <nav class="navbar">
      <ul role="list" class="navbar__links">
        <li><a href="/">Logo</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">Case Studies</a></li>
        <li><a href="/portfolio">Studio</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Reach out</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
      <header>
        <div class="hero__title">
          <span>エターニティー</span>
          <h1>STUDIO EIEN</h1>
        </div>
        <p>We craft timeless digital ⟡ experiences for businesses, content creators, and artists. Studio Eien helps you take the first steps toward building an online presence that embodies your vision. The presence that tells the world what you stand for.</p>
      </header>
      <div>
        <hr />
        <p>Grid System V.03</p>
        <p>VERSION: 03.2025 ⟡ PLATFORM: DIGITAL EXPERIENCE</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process">
      <header>
        <div class="process__title">
          <span>プロセス</span>
          <h2>PROCESS</h2>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div>
        <article>
          <h3>01. Strategy</h3>
          <p>Understanding shapes direction.</p>
          <p>We start by diving deep into goals, values, and audience. Through open conversation, we gather the insights that shape a thoughtful, informed strategy before any pixels are drawn.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>02. Design</h3>
          <p>Purpose guides beauty.</p>
          <p>We translate your content and story into visual concepts that speak your brand’s language. Every layout, color, and interaction is intentional; designed to align beauty with usability.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>03. Code</h3>
          <p>Precision becomes experience.</p>
          <p>We build using modern frameworks and clean and scalable code. Ensuring, your website is fast, accessible, and ready. Every feature and detail is crafted with precision.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div>
        <hr />
        <p>SECTION: PROCESS ⟡ METHOD SIGNATURE: V.01</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="quote">
      <div>
        <h4>永遠 Eternity</h4>
        <p>(Noun) — which may take the genitive case particle no, Na-adjective (keiyōdōshi). Eternity; perpetuity; permanence; immortality.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
      <header></header>
    </section>
  </main>

  <section class="services"></section>

  <section class="conversion"></section>
</Layout>
